OL,3,GNEWSAHow a councillor used Snapchat to
OL,4,Acatfish army cadets
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor, cadet, carer. Rylan Ray
OL,7,Fbuilt a reputation as a young volunteer
OL,8,Fcommitted to public service. However,
OL,9,Fbeneath the respectable veneer was a
OL,10,Fman who was using social media apps
OL,11,Fsuch as Snapchat to groom and deceive
OL,12,Fteenagers.
OL,14,FOn Thursday, the 26-year-old former
OL,15,FConservative politician was convicted
OL,16,Fof 28 sexual offences including sexual
OL,17,Fassault and making indecent photographs
OL,18,Fof children.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
