OL,3,GNEWSAHow a councillor used Snapchat to
OL,4,Acatfish army cadets
OL,5,
OL,6,FVictims included children he met
OL,7,Fthrough his role with the
OL,8,FCambridgeshire Army Cadet Force. Jurors
OL,9,Falso found him guilty of raping a man.
OL,11,FHow did a man trusted by young people
OL,12,Fand elected to represent thousands of
OL,13,Fresidents come to commit such serious
OL,14,Fcrimes?
